# Ticket 50: the DB image's own build context denylist. BuildKit reads
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore in place of the root .dockerignore, which now
# also leaves out db/ and other non-app inputs so an unchanged app builds an
# identical app image. The security entries (.env*, *.pem and the CA bundle
# exception) must stay the same in both files.
#
# Denylist build context for the production image (ticket 29).
#
# `.env*` is the critical entry: `next build` copies `.env` and
# `.env.production` into `.next/standalone`, so a local env file left in the
# context would ship inside the image.
.env*
*.pem
# Ticket 40: the public RDS CA bundle the image verifies RDS TLS against.
!certs/rds-global-bundle.pem

# VCS, dependencies and build output: rebuilt inside the image.
.git
node_modules
.next
dist

# Local tooling, test and log output.
coverage
logs
e2e/.auth
test-results
playwright-report
blob-report
graphify-out
docs/.vitepress/cache
docs/.vitepress/dist
.claude
.venv
*.tsbuildinfo
